WEBVTT

01:31.799 --> 01:37.117
[Flourished Peony]

01:37.117 --> 01:40.176
[Episode 32]

02:35.479 --> 02:37.560
Doesn't your mother want you
to have a good husband?

02:38.759 --> 02:39.919
Help me deal with Lianzhou,

02:41.360 --> 02:42.560
and I will do you a favor too.

02:47.719 --> 02:50.039
You can only deceive Prince Ning.

02:51.680 --> 02:53.319
How could you deceive my mother?

02:53.319 --> 02:56.000
Get up and go.

02:56.000 --> 02:57.159
Get out.

02:58.439 --> 02:59.520
Whether I have a good husband or not,

03:00.520 --> 03:01.879
I can enjoy my life.

03:14.120 --> 03:15.432
Mother.

03:17.400 --> 03:18.840
The promises I made
when I first came to Chang'an

03:18.840 --> 03:20.039
have all been fulfilled.

03:22.479 --> 03:24.039
Do you see it from the heaven?

03:31.360 --> 03:32.840
The wine is really strong.

03:34.240 --> 03:35.400
I'll go out to get some air.

03:37.879 --> 03:39.000
I've saved some of this wine.

03:43.000 --> 03:46.400
Let your mother continue drinking with you.

04:08.960 --> 04:10.199
He's not my real husband,

04:12.080 --> 04:13.240
but a real bosom friend.

04:15.039 --> 04:17.240
Mother.

04:17.240 --> 04:18.839
I am now living

04:18.839 --> 04:19.959
freely and happily.

04:21.839 --> 04:22.959
Don't worry about me.

04:26.079 --> 04:27.560
I'll have a drink with you.

05:23.519 --> 05:27.439
Mother, is that you?

05:34.680 --> 05:35.759
You heard what

05:35.759 --> 05:37.120
I just said,

05:38.040 --> 05:39.439
and felt sorry for me, right?

05:43.399 --> 05:44.839
The way of doing business

05:46.000 --> 05:47.360
is indeed more complicated

05:47.360 --> 05:48.560
and harder

05:49.319 --> 05:50.568
than I had imagined.

05:53.399 --> 05:54.600
But rest assured.

05:56.680 --> 05:57.720
I am now

05:58.680 --> 06:00.720
not just your daughter,

06:02.720 --> 06:04.160
but also a shopkeeper.

06:05.720 --> 06:07.279
People are counting on me.

06:13.600 --> 06:14.839
I can hold up.

06:58.279 --> 06:59.592
Who is wandering at night?

07:04.199 --> 07:05.839
Floral Envoy.

07:05.839 --> 07:08.480
At curfew, the streets are dark.

07:08.480 --> 07:09.720
I will illuminate your way

07:09.720 --> 07:11.399
and escort you back.

07:11.399 --> 07:13.000
A couple walking intimately at night.

07:13.000 --> 07:15.519
How can we let an outsider accompany? Get lost.

07:15.519 --> 07:16.840
Yes.

07:20.600 --> 07:23.079
Who is speaking?

07:23.079 --> 07:25.680
No one. Go back to sleep.

07:26.439 --> 07:27.759
Who are you?

07:28.639 --> 07:30.639
I…

07:30.639 --> 07:31.920
I am Jiang Changyang.

07:34.120 --> 07:35.360
Jiang Changyang?

07:35.360 --> 07:36.600
I know him.

07:41.279 --> 07:42.759
What kind of person

07:43.399 --> 07:44.680
is Jiang Changyang you know?

07:47.639 --> 07:49.839
He is always smiling.

07:51.160 --> 07:54.399
People say he is scheming.

07:56.600 --> 07:57.959
But I know

07:59.240 --> 08:01.680
he has something on his mind.

08:02.439 --> 08:03.800
And this matter

08:04.360 --> 08:06.240
is something bitter.

08:07.240 --> 08:09.079
What is it?

08:09.079 --> 08:10.360
I don't know.

08:12.160 --> 08:13.279
But I know

08:15.399 --> 08:17.000
he is my husband.

08:21.000 --> 08:23.560
♫ If the heart is like frost ♫

08:23.560 --> 08:27.336
♫ Congealing so much of the past ♫

08:28.639 --> 08:30.560
Let me tell you a secret.

08:35.279 --> 08:36.424
It's fake.

08:40.520 --> 08:42.120
♫ Can it ♫

08:42.120 --> 08:46.972
♫ Finally touch a sunny day ♫

08:50.792 --> 08:54.707
♫ Clouds are hidden by night ♫

08:56.120 --> 08:57.559
Time to rest.

08:58.664 --> 09:01.736
♫ Seeking a place to rest ♫

09:02.440 --> 09:03.879
Time to rest.

09:13.240 --> 09:15.600
Mudan, wake up.

09:16.519 --> 09:17.896
We're home.

09:21.096 --> 09:23.144
♫ Yet you shine as light ♫

09:23.144 --> 09:27.304
♫ Piercing through my heart ♫

09:27.304 --> 09:29.640
♫ If love is like frost ♫

09:29.640 --> 09:34.216
♫ There's a flickering candle ♫

09:34.216 --> 09:35.720
♫ No words are said ♫

09:35.720 --> 09:37.795
♫ Yet for you ♫

09:37.795 --> 09:40.776
♫ I'll go ahead ♫

09:49.256 --> 09:52.552
[Flower Cultivating Soil]

09:58.240 --> 09:59.960
I shouldn't have drunk so much last night.

10:01.720 --> 10:03.399
Mr. Hu.

10:03.399 --> 10:04.559
Stop it.

10:04.559 --> 10:05.559
This pit

10:07.200 --> 10:08.240
is dug too deep,

10:08.879 --> 10:10.919
which can cause peonies not to flourish.

10:12.080 --> 10:14.320
Mr. Wang's pit is too shallow,

10:15.120 --> 10:16.440
neglecting the care of the roots,

10:16.440 --> 10:17.840
resulting in weak branches.

10:18.440 --> 10:19.799
Look,

10:19.799 --> 10:21.000
take this as an example.

10:22.159 --> 10:23.919
The depth of planting…

10:23.919 --> 10:25.039
You should ensure that the root

10:25.039 --> 10:26.879
and the part where it connects to the branch

10:26.879 --> 10:28.039
are level with the ground.

10:28.799 --> 10:30.600
This pit is also a bit deep.

10:30.600 --> 10:32.679
You'll have to fill it in a bit later.

10:32.679 --> 10:34.519
Shopkeeper.

10:34.519 --> 10:35.519
Madam Tang.

10:35.519 --> 10:38.480
Shopkeeper, a handsome young man
just asked to see you.

10:38.480 --> 10:40.360
And I said you were busy

10:40.360 --> 10:41.399
and had no time to meet anyone.

10:41.399 --> 10:43.559
So I told him to come back in two hours.

10:43.559 --> 10:45.240
He gave me this when he left,

10:45.240 --> 10:46.559
saying it was a thank-you gift for you.

10:48.759 --> 10:50.360
Jiang Changyang?

10:54.360 --> 10:56.159
- It's food.
- Come on.

10:56.159 --> 10:57.360
Thank you, Madam Tang.

10:57.360 --> 10:59.559
Everyone, take a break
and have something to eat.

10:59.559 --> 11:00.519
- Here, Madam Tang.
- Come on.

11:00.519 --> 11:01.840
Share it.

11:01.840 --> 11:03.519
Here, shopkeeper, you try one first.

11:03.519 --> 11:04.600
Thank you, Madam Tang.

11:05.399 --> 11:08.840
- Here, Mr. Wang.
- Thank you, Madam Tang.

11:08.840 --> 11:10.440
- Come on, have one
- Thank you, Madam Tang.

11:11.440 --> 11:12.712
Osmanthus?

11:13.919 --> 11:16.279
Madam Tang, how is this person dressed?

11:16.279 --> 11:17.640
Where did he go?

11:18.799 --> 11:20.120
He went out that way.

11:22.000 --> 11:23.320
You'll handle it, Madam Tang.

11:27.399 --> 11:31.200
This is the legendary life of this woman.

11:32.080 --> 11:33.519
Thank you, everyone.

11:33.519 --> 11:35.240
Hurry up, the rain is getting heavier.

11:36.399 --> 11:37.480
Hurry and pack up the stall.

11:37.480 --> 11:38.720
Well said.

11:38.720 --> 11:39.799
The story of Miss Qin

11:39.799 --> 11:41.000
is truly legendary.

11:41.000 --> 11:42.519
It's very delightful to hear.

11:43.159 --> 11:44.399
Indeed.

11:44.399 --> 11:45.639
The life of this woman

11:45.639 --> 11:46.879
is indeed very legendary.

11:46.879 --> 11:48.399
- Yes.
- Come on.

11:48.399 --> 11:49.559
The rain is getting heavier.

11:58.440 --> 12:00.136
Qin Liulang.

12:09.080 --> 12:10.280
Lady He.

12:18.000 --> 12:19.440
- Go fetch sand and stone.
- Alright.

12:38.320 --> 12:39.720
How is he?

12:41.039 --> 12:43.559
His coughing fits are an old ailment,

12:43.559 --> 12:45.399
require cordyceps and agarwood

12:45.399 --> 12:47.399
for nourishing and conditioning.

12:47.399 --> 12:50.039
But these are not common herbs.

12:50.039 --> 12:51.360
I think he can't afford them.

12:54.879 --> 12:56.399
Shengyi has discord with family members,

12:56.960 --> 12:58.799
only has deep affection
for this younger brother.

12:59.759 --> 13:01.720
After Liulang's father passed away,

13:01.720 --> 13:03.639
his elder brother and sister-in-law
took over the farmland,

13:03.639 --> 13:05.519
unable to accommodate him.

13:05.519 --> 13:07.360
He came to Chang'an alone,

13:07.360 --> 13:08.600
without a penny.

13:08.600 --> 13:09.799
And he even gave me a thank-you gift.

13:12.200 --> 13:13.279
I will pay for his medicine.

13:15.159 --> 13:16.600
Remember,

13:16.600 --> 13:17.679
do not write the real name of the herbs

13:17.679 --> 13:19.120
on the prescription.

13:19.120 --> 13:21.399
Just write some common herbs,

13:21.399 --> 13:23.519
like licorice.

13:23.519 --> 13:24.960
Don't let him find it out.

13:26.399 --> 13:27.480
Rest assured.

13:27.480 --> 13:29.399
To ensure the Qingshuzhai open smoothly,

13:29.399 --> 13:30.919
I have already made many medicines,

13:30.919 --> 13:32.639
looking for people to test them.

13:32.639 --> 13:35.120
I'll just tell him to help me
test a few new medicines.

13:35.120 --> 13:36.120
He should accept it without guilt.

13:36.679 --> 13:37.799
Give him some donkey-hide gelatin

13:37.799 --> 13:39.440
to nourish his body.

13:58.759 --> 14:00.440
Why did you run off after cooking?

14:05.240 --> 14:06.840
We would pay whoever works

14:06.840 --> 14:08.039
in the Fragrance Garden.

14:09.879 --> 14:11.840
You allow me stay
in the Fragrance Garden to recuperate,

14:11.840 --> 14:13.399
and I have no way to repay.

14:13.399 --> 14:14.440
Only by working in the kitchen

14:14.440 --> 14:16.159
to play to my strengths.

14:16.159 --> 14:17.360
Thanks to you that I can stay here.

14:17.360 --> 14:18.399
With low status,

14:19.120 --> 14:20.519
I don't dare to sit with you all.

14:21.480 --> 14:23.600
Here in the Fragrance Garden,
we are all one family,

14:23.600 --> 14:25.559
without any distinction
of high or low, noble or humble.

14:25.559 --> 14:26.952
You too.

14:35.159 --> 14:36.240
But if you go now,

14:36.240 --> 14:37.519
I'm afraid those pork knuckles and chicken legs

14:37.519 --> 14:38.639
have all been snatched up.

14:39.559 --> 14:41.600
Why don't you accompany me
for a stroll in the West Market?

14:42.360 --> 14:45.080
I'll take you to try
Shengyi's starched noodles?

14:53.320 --> 14:54.440
Okay.

14:55.039 --> 14:57.240
Hu cakes for sale.

14:57.240 --> 14:59.080
Try them, these candied fruits

14:59.080 --> 15:00.200
are delicious.

15:02.919 --> 15:03.919
Shopkeeper,

15:03.919 --> 15:05.224
you first.

15:08.968 --> 15:10.159
Five wens a bowl.

15:10.159 --> 15:12.039
Previously, Shengyi and I
were falsely accused by Wang Qing,

15:12.039 --> 15:13.519
for selling sick flowers.

15:13.519 --> 15:15.320
We refunded and compensated all the customers.

15:15.320 --> 15:16.600
And we only

15:16.600 --> 15:18.480
had money for a bowl of noodles,

15:19.559 --> 15:21.080
so we came here

15:21.080 --> 15:22.559
to have a bowl of noodles

15:22.559 --> 15:23.799
to pull ourselves together.

15:24.600 --> 15:26.159
After arriving,

15:26.159 --> 15:28.168
the owner asked us what toppings we wanted,

15:29.445 --> 15:31.600
she said to add dried shrimps,

15:31.600 --> 15:34.080
but I said to add mutton.

15:35.559 --> 15:36.879
My sister likes to eat mutton.

15:38.159 --> 15:39.879
While I like to eat dried shrimp.

15:46.120 --> 15:47.519
Thank you for pitying me,

15:48.200 --> 15:49.480
willing to tell me so much

15:49.480 --> 15:50.480
about my sister.

15:53.519 --> 15:55.200
Shengyi is my best friend.

15:56.440 --> 15:58.639
Every time I mention her,

15:58.639 --> 15:59.919
it is

15:59.919 --> 16:01.320
a bit upset,

16:02.879 --> 16:04.279
but I feel warm inside.

16:05.399 --> 16:09.720
Because there are still people
who think of her and miss her.

16:14.720 --> 16:16.320
Feel free to ask whatever you want.

16:16.919 --> 16:18.279
I will surely tell you everything I know.

16:22.399 --> 16:24.879
My sister lived a life of hardship.

16:25.799 --> 16:27.399
Fortunately,

16:27.399 --> 16:28.936
she met you.

16:30.480 --> 16:31.759
It's my fortune

16:31.759 --> 16:32.879
to meet her too.

16:35.279 --> 16:36.600
Before Shengyi died,

16:36.600 --> 16:37.879
she lives cautiously and prudently.

16:38.480 --> 16:40.320
She definitely wouldn't
want you to do the same.

16:42.159 --> 16:43.600
She is gone,

16:44.120 --> 16:45.399
but if you don't mind,

16:46.440 --> 16:48.240
you can consider me your sister.

16:51.120 --> 16:52.519
Therefore,

16:53.240 --> 16:54.399
just eat

16:55.519 --> 16:57.320
whatever you want.

16:57.320 --> 16:58.440
Go ahead.

16:58.440 --> 16:59.752
Okay.

17:15.480 --> 17:17.559
I noticed that you walk uneasily,

17:18.799 --> 17:19.960
it must be that the shoes are too small

17:20.640 --> 17:22.319
to fit.

17:22.319 --> 17:23.319
If you wear them for a long time,

17:23.319 --> 17:24.519
they will definitely injure your feet.

17:25.279 --> 17:26.599
I assessed by your length

17:26.599 --> 17:27.839
and bought you a pair of shoes.

17:27.839 --> 17:29.240
I am not sure if they will fit.

17:29.240 --> 17:31.200
Give them a try.

17:31.200 --> 17:33.279
You have already bought me clothes.

17:33.279 --> 17:34.400
I can't accept

17:34.400 --> 17:35.920
these shoes.

17:35.920 --> 17:38.160
What did I say just now?

17:38.160 --> 17:39.160
Consider me your sister.

17:44.359 --> 17:45.480
Mudan.

17:46.759 --> 17:48.240
Since I am your sister,

17:48.240 --> 17:49.240
just accept what I give you.

17:50.760 --> 17:51.912
Come on.

17:53.799 --> 17:55.319
Put on the shoes.

17:55.319 --> 17:56.799
Let's go home.

17:56.799 --> 17:57.799
May you

17:58.519 --> 18:00.232
walk steadily ahead.

18:09.240 --> 18:10.440
Thank you,

18:11.279 --> 18:12.616
Mudan.

18:15.480 --> 18:16.808
[Qingshuzhai]
Take care on your way.

18:25.240 --> 18:26.240
[Beauty Pill]
Everyone,

18:26.240 --> 18:28.079
at the Qingshuzhai,
we incorporate medicine into cosmetics

18:28.079 --> 18:29.279
for nourishing beauty and health.

18:29.279 --> 18:30.599
We have

18:30.599 --> 18:32.359
everything you need.

18:32.359 --> 18:35.200
Lady, my hair feels
dry and lifeless these days.

18:35.200 --> 18:37.240
Do you have anything for hair nourishment?

18:37.240 --> 18:39.000
Take a look at this.

18:39.000 --> 18:41.519
This is our hair nourishment pill, Yunbin Pill.

18:41.519 --> 18:42.559
Take as needed.

18:43.119 --> 18:44.119
Lady.

18:44.119 --> 18:45.839
I often feel my mouth is dry,
my breath is smelly,

18:45.839 --> 18:47.519
and the root of my tongue tastes bitter.

18:47.519 --> 18:49.000
I wonder if there's anything
to freshen the breath.

18:49.000 --> 18:51.039
Don't worry.

18:51.039 --> 18:53.039
We have refreshing scented water

18:53.039 --> 18:54.799
to take orally here.

18:54.799 --> 18:56.264
Take a sniff.

18:56.799 --> 18:58.079
Lady.

18:58.079 --> 18:59.400
I've not been eating and sleeping well lately,

18:59.400 --> 19:00.400
and spots have appeared on my face.

19:00.400 --> 19:02.119
What should I do?

19:02.119 --> 19:03.200
Right next to you.

19:03.200 --> 19:04.200
Look,

19:04.200 --> 19:05.559
this is the Beauty Pill.

19:05.559 --> 19:06.880
It can nourish the skin and remove spots.

19:07.480 --> 19:09.279
Lady, my skin quality

19:09.279 --> 19:10.839
- Here, take this.
- is not as good as it used to be.

19:10.839 --> 19:12.640
Look, my face is yellow and dry.

19:12.640 --> 19:14.039
Is this Beauty Pill suitable for me?

19:15.079 --> 19:16.559
This one.

19:16.559 --> 19:18.200
This is our rose facial cream.

19:18.200 --> 19:19.759
It's moisturizing and nourishing,
I'll apply it for you.

19:19.759 --> 19:20.839
- Thank you.
- Okay.

19:22.519 --> 19:24.000
- How is it?
- It's so moisturizing.

19:24.000 --> 19:25.480
Come and take a look.

19:25.480 --> 19:26.759
Really nice.

19:26.759 --> 19:28.039
No rush, one at a time.

19:28.039 --> 19:29.519
It's quite good.

19:29.519 --> 19:31.279
Here, get your medicine with your prescription.

19:31.279 --> 19:32.616
Thank you.

19:33.279 --> 19:34.664
Next, please.

19:35.599 --> 19:37.960
Come on, slow down.

19:40.880 --> 19:42.240
How long has this condition been going on?

19:43.119 --> 19:44.808
A couple of days.

19:47.119 --> 19:49.240
You have always favored
luxurious clothes and ornaments.

19:49.240 --> 19:50.559
Why…?

19:51.160 --> 19:52.920
Mr. Jiang

19:52.920 --> 19:55.000
must be accustomed
to seeing those intricate attires,

19:55.000 --> 19:56.000
that's why he likes

19:56.000 --> 19:57.599
the simple girls like He Weifang.

19:58.240 --> 19:59.400
In that case,

19:59.400 --> 20:01.000
I can also do without intricate attires,

20:01.000 --> 20:02.519
and decorate myself with some flowers,

20:02.519 --> 20:03.839
adding a touch of wild charm

20:03.839 --> 20:05.320
to win his favor.

20:25.759 --> 20:27.119
You indeed have good taste.

20:27.119 --> 20:29.759
With this flower,
it makes you look more elegant.

20:30.759 --> 20:32.119
The flowers grown by He Weifang

20:32.119 --> 20:33.400
do have some use.

20:34.079 --> 20:36.000
This is Mudan's garden. How dare you to come

20:38.880 --> 20:40.319
and pick flowers?

20:40.319 --> 20:41.759
Rest assured, Zhu Fu.

20:41.759 --> 20:43.680
I serve Mr. Jiang along with Mudan.

20:43.680 --> 20:45.000
We should be friendly and united.

20:45.599 --> 20:47.519
I merely picked a flower.

20:47.519 --> 20:49.200
She is not a person with a narrow-mind.

20:49.200 --> 20:50.960
Who cares?

20:50.960 --> 20:52.359
Taking without asking is stealing.

20:52.359 --> 20:53.736
Give it back to me.

20:54.680 --> 20:55.720
Madam.

20:55.720 --> 20:57.160
Zhu Fu, how dare you to push me!

20:57.160 --> 20:58.160
More than that,

20:58.160 --> 20:59.440
I dare to hit you.

20:59.440 --> 21:01.279
Let me tell you,
if you come to pick flowers again,

21:01.279 --> 21:02.640
I'll beat you hard.

21:02.640 --> 21:04.000
- Go.
- Get out.

21:04.000 --> 21:05.096
Madam.

21:05.759 --> 21:07.240
Get out and never come back.

21:07.240 --> 21:08.712
Leave.

21:11.000 --> 21:12.240
How dare she humiliate me!

21:12.240 --> 21:13.880
I will make you pay.

21:13.880 --> 21:15.688
Madam, are you alright?

21:18.039 --> 21:19.464
Did you get hurt from the fall?

21:21.759 --> 21:23.480
Yunbin Pill and a sachet,

21:23.480 --> 21:24.680
a total of eighty-five wens.

21:27.160 --> 21:28.839
Shopkeeper, here are one hundred wens.

21:43.119 --> 21:44.559
Jixiang.

21:44.559 --> 21:45.799
Please tell Chun

21:45.799 --> 21:47.079
that

21:47.079 --> 21:48.160
I am feeling unwell,

21:48.720 --> 21:49.720
so I'll return to the Fragrance Garden first.

21:50.960 --> 21:52.319
Yes.

21:52.319 --> 21:53.319
Where did this quack doctor come from?

21:54.000 --> 21:55.119
Other physicians said my wife

21:55.119 --> 21:56.440
would get better just with some tonics.

21:56.440 --> 21:58.359
Why did you say she's running out of time?

21:59.440 --> 22:01.440
Don't believe in their consoling remedies.

22:01.440 --> 22:03.799
Listen to me. Save the money and you can…

22:03.799 --> 22:06.400
Fine. You dare to curse my wife,
I'll smash your shop.

22:06.400 --> 22:07.960
Sir, calm down.

22:07.960 --> 22:09.000
It's all a misunderstanding.

22:09.000 --> 22:10.880
Calm down. It's a misunderstanding.

22:11.759 --> 22:13.599
It's our shopkeeper who has offended you.

22:13.599 --> 22:15.599
On behalf of her, I offer you an apology.

22:16.880 --> 22:19.079
This ailment is elusive
and varies from time to time.

22:19.079 --> 22:21.000
Different physicians, different days,

22:21.000 --> 22:22.519
you might get

22:22.519 --> 22:23.960
the different diagnosis.

22:23.960 --> 22:25.000
Look,

22:25.000 --> 22:27.160
we won't charge you the consultation fee.

22:27.160 --> 22:28.319
You should seek another physician

22:28.319 --> 22:29.599
to have another diagnosis.

22:33.240 --> 22:34.319
Let's go, my lady.

22:34.319 --> 22:35.920
Lady, take it easy.

22:35.920 --> 22:37.759
Be careful.

22:37.759 --> 22:39.440
- Jixiang, send them off.
- Yes.

22:39.440 --> 22:40.960
I'm really sorry.

22:51.039 --> 22:52.359
That couple

22:52.359 --> 22:53.640
had already seen a physician,

22:54.799 --> 22:56.640
yet still came here for a consultation.

22:56.640 --> 22:58.559
They already have an answer,

22:59.119 --> 23:00.720
just refuse to accept it,

23:01.279 --> 23:02.440
and hope others

23:02.440 --> 23:04.400
could deceive them as well.

23:04.400 --> 23:05.559
So,

23:05.559 --> 23:06.759
they might feel a bit better.

23:08.599 --> 23:09.920
But I am a physician,

23:10.559 --> 23:12.960
not a charlatan who deceives people.

23:14.400 --> 23:16.160
Yes, I understand.

23:17.720 --> 23:19.432
Mudan.

23:21.160 --> 23:22.680
I might not be suitable to be a shopkeeper.

23:25.519 --> 23:27.640
Don't say so.

23:27.640 --> 23:28.839
This is only your first day.

23:28.839 --> 23:30.160
You have already done very well.

23:30.799 --> 23:32.200
Later, I will arrange

23:32.200 --> 23:34.480
a sweet-talking assistant

23:34.480 --> 23:36.160
to work with you.

23:36.160 --> 23:38.640
Then such things would never happen again.

23:38.640 --> 23:40.640
Shopkeeper.

23:40.640 --> 23:41.920
What's the matter, Madam Tang?

23:43.039 --> 23:45.880
Shopkeeper, you'd better go back and check now.

23:45.880 --> 23:47.279
Aman likes quiet when doing embroidery,

23:47.279 --> 23:48.880
so she finds Tao's lute playing annoyed.

23:48.880 --> 23:50.680
I thought to change their living place.

23:50.680 --> 23:52.319
When choosing the rooms,

23:52.319 --> 23:53.480
Tao and Jinniang

23:53.480 --> 23:54.599
got into a dispute.

23:54.599 --> 23:57.000
And Gui was building a water channel,

23:57.000 --> 23:58.039
and he mixed the leftover soil that was dug out

23:58.039 --> 24:00.200
with Mr. Hu's flower cultivating soil.

24:00.200 --> 24:02.359
And Mr. Hu complained him about it,

24:02.359 --> 24:04.279
but Gui would not take it,

24:04.279 --> 24:05.839
and the two of them started fighting.

24:08.240 --> 24:09.319
Not a single one

24:09.319 --> 24:10.480
gives me peace of mind.

24:11.640 --> 24:13.359
Let's go and check.

24:15.319 --> 24:16.392
Come on.

24:20.168 --> 24:21.440
Mudan.

24:21.440 --> 24:22.559
Shopkeeper.

24:41.920 --> 24:44.200
Mudan, you're awake.

24:45.119 --> 24:46.720
You scared us.

24:46.720 --> 24:48.119
Chun said you've been exhausted for these days,

24:48.119 --> 24:49.240
lacking vital energy,

24:49.240 --> 24:50.599
and caught a chill.

24:50.599 --> 24:52.400
Your body is getting weaker,

24:52.400 --> 24:53.440
that's why you fell ill.

24:54.039 --> 24:56.039
You should rest well

24:56.039 --> 24:57.240
and must not overwork

24:57.240 --> 24:58.792
and overthink.

24:59.640 --> 25:00.680
Fu.

25:00.680 --> 25:01.920
Go and inform everyone

25:01.920 --> 25:03.599
that Mudan is awake,
in order to let everyone be at ease.

25:04.160 --> 25:07.240
Okay, I'll go check if Chun
has finished preparing the medicine.

25:30.400 --> 25:32.240
How is the trouble

25:32.240 --> 25:33.544
at the Fragrance Garden?

25:34.799 --> 25:36.079
If you don't show up,

25:36.079 --> 25:37.319
the sky won't fall.

25:37.319 --> 25:38.880
Take care of your health first.

25:40.720 --> 25:42.240
You ask this once you wake up.

25:43.079 --> 25:44.359
Don't you have anything else you want to ask?

25:47.079 --> 25:50.200
Then why are you here?

25:52.279 --> 25:54.240
My concubine is ill, how could I not come?

25:54.880 --> 25:56.480
Let alone being suspected by Lianzhou,

25:56.480 --> 25:57.480
Zhu Fu

25:57.480 --> 25:58.519
wouldn't let me off.

26:03.960 --> 26:05.200
You've just opened your new shop.

26:06.039 --> 26:07.640
The makeup on your face is very thick.

26:08.279 --> 26:09.680
Wipe it off clean

26:09.680 --> 26:10.759
before you go to sleep,

26:10.759 --> 26:12.072
it'll make you more comfortable.

26:14.680 --> 26:15.680
Mudan.

26:20.640 --> 26:21.720
Mudan.

26:21.720 --> 26:22.720
This is…

26:24.079 --> 26:26.319
- He is…
- I am her husband.

26:26.880 --> 26:28.119
You must be Qin Liulang, right?

26:29.240 --> 26:31.200
Mudan regards you as her younger brother,

26:31.799 --> 26:33.119
so you are my younger brother too.

26:33.880 --> 26:35.039
From now on, just call me Changyang.

26:35.640 --> 26:37.192
Don't bother with the formalities.

26:38.680 --> 26:39.759
Floral Envoy.

26:40.680 --> 26:42.480
Although I consider Mudan my sister,

26:42.480 --> 26:43.680
we have no blood relationship

26:44.559 --> 26:45.640
and I dare not claim kinship with you.

26:47.720 --> 26:48.840
Mudan.

26:49.440 --> 26:50.720
This is the cold noodles

26:51.279 --> 26:53.279
made from locust leaf juice and flour.

26:53.279 --> 26:54.599
Its color is nice,

26:54.599 --> 26:55.680
and it tastes fresh and sweet.

26:55.680 --> 26:57.079
It's refreshing,

26:57.079 --> 26:58.440
suitable for you.

26:58.440 --> 26:59.920
Liulang, you've worked hard
cooking the noodles.

26:59.920 --> 27:01.192
Let me do it.

27:08.920 --> 27:10.240
One should do one's best

27:10.240 --> 27:11.440
to take care of the sick.

27:12.160 --> 27:13.680
How can we let the sick fend for themselves?

27:14.640 --> 27:16.839
Come on, I'll wipe your face.

27:16.839 --> 27:18.480
Thank you for your reminder.

27:18.480 --> 27:19.720
After feeding the noodles,

27:19.720 --> 27:20.720
I will wipe it myself.

27:21.480 --> 27:22.799
The noodles are spilled.

27:22.799 --> 27:24.079
I should do it myself.

27:24.960 --> 27:26.440
I am not severely sick,

27:26.440 --> 27:27.480
and my hands are okay.

27:28.079 --> 27:29.240
I can do it myself.

27:31.599 --> 27:33.599
Why have Mr. Hu and the others
gone to look for Gui again?

27:33.599 --> 27:35.799
Are they going to fight? Let's go take a look.

27:35.799 --> 27:37.039
What is wrong again?

27:37.039 --> 27:38.664
No.

27:39.599 --> 27:40.680
I'll just go take a look.

27:40.680 --> 27:41.880
I'll be right back.

27:43.640 --> 27:44.680
Rest assured.

27:44.680 --> 27:46.119
Madam Tang will take good care of everyone.

28:12.359 --> 28:15.200
Liulang, go check on the medicine.

28:17.480 --> 28:18.920
I want to stay here to take care of Mudan.

28:20.000 --> 28:22.400
We have something personal to say.

28:22.400 --> 28:23.880
You shouldn't stay here.

28:36.200 --> 28:37.960
What do you want to say to me?

28:37.960 --> 28:39.200
You even asked him away.

28:40.200 --> 28:41.680
If he's been staying here,

28:41.680 --> 28:43.048
can you still go out?

28:44.200 --> 28:45.400
Eat the noodles.

28:45.400 --> 28:47.400
I will accompany you to check it out later.

29:05.319 --> 29:07.359
Wrong, Fu.

29:07.359 --> 29:09.279
This is precious agarwood for Liulang.

29:09.839 --> 29:11.519
This is the effective prescription

29:11.519 --> 29:12.680
[Cold Medicine]
for treating Mudan's colds.

29:19.680 --> 29:20.880
Wasn't I eating licorice?

29:21.440 --> 29:22.640
Why is it agarwood?

29:22.640 --> 29:24.519
Liulang, why are you here?

29:25.599 --> 29:27.279
So, the medicine I usually take

29:27.279 --> 29:28.279
is so precious.

29:29.119 --> 29:30.279
Why did Mudan keep this from me?

29:32.000 --> 29:33.160
She is afraid of you

29:33.160 --> 29:35.119
refuses to take the medicine
because it is too expensive,

29:35.119 --> 29:36.319
so she kept it from you.

29:38.200 --> 29:40.240
Mudan treats you like her own family,

29:40.240 --> 29:41.480
so she will naturally treat you well.

29:41.480 --> 29:43.480
Just treat her twice as well.

29:46.000 --> 29:47.176
Right.

29:49.519 --> 29:50.759
She suddenly fell ill,

29:51.359 --> 29:52.559
so I forgot to give this to you.

29:57.359 --> 29:59.960
Mudan made the cakes too?

30:01.519 --> 30:03.720
She's worried
that you're missing Shengyi too much,

30:04.240 --> 30:05.839
so she tried to make you

30:05.839 --> 30:07.079
flower cakes as Shengyi did.

30:14.880 --> 30:16.000
After my sister left home,

30:16.680 --> 30:18.400
then no one else worries about me

30:18.960 --> 30:20.000
and treats me that well.

30:31.759 --> 30:33.192
Delicious.

30:33.759 --> 30:36.640
Just like the ones my sister makes.

30:36.640 --> 30:38.152
Really?

30:49.480 --> 30:50.599
Liulang.

30:51.160 --> 30:53.359
Something wrong with you?

30:53.359 --> 30:54.799
Is this delicious?

30:57.960 --> 30:59.119
It tastes awful.

31:07.920 --> 31:09.000
Be careful.

31:09.000 --> 31:10.504
I'm okay.

31:16.160 --> 31:17.480
What are you doing?

31:18.000 --> 31:19.519
Nothing.

31:19.519 --> 31:21.079
Mr. Hu was annoyed

31:21.079 --> 31:23.599
because the flower cultivating soil
he applied fertilizer

31:23.599 --> 31:25.759
got soiled by the leftover dirt dug up by Gui.

31:26.440 --> 31:28.519
He was worried about
delaying the planting season,

31:28.519 --> 31:30.039
so he started arguing.

31:30.039 --> 31:32.960
I need to apply fertilizer
to the flower cultivating soil for tomorrow,

31:32.960 --> 31:34.480
lest they quarrel again.

31:36.960 --> 31:38.279
I allow you to get out,

31:38.279 --> 31:39.640
but not to let you work while ill.

31:41.759 --> 31:43.119
I'm fine now.

31:43.720 --> 31:45.119
My fever has gone.

31:46.480 --> 31:48.240
Really. If you don't believe me,
feel it for yourself.

31:48.240 --> 31:49.704
Come on, feel it for yourself.

31:50.880 --> 31:52.160
I don't care.

31:52.799 --> 31:54.000
I only know

31:54.000 --> 31:55.440
that we have just married,

31:55.440 --> 31:56.599
and you've already been sick and fainting.

31:57.400 --> 31:58.759
If you work and catch a cold tonight,

31:58.759 --> 31:59.839
you might fall ill and not get up.

31:59.839 --> 32:01.960
Then others might say that I treated you badly.

32:01.960 --> 32:03.279
If you do not tell,

32:03.279 --> 32:04.680
how would others know?

32:04.680 --> 32:05.799
Don't forget

32:05.799 --> 32:07.160
Lianzhou is still living in my mansion.

32:10.359 --> 32:11.680
If you don't recover soon,

32:12.559 --> 32:13.880
it won't take long

32:13.880 --> 32:15.640
that everyone in the city will be talking

32:15.640 --> 32:17.119
about the shopkeeper of Qingshuzhai

32:17.119 --> 32:18.400
not being in good health,

32:18.400 --> 32:20.319
implying that the products sold
must be of no use.

32:22.640 --> 32:24.480
You are no longer just a shopkeeper
of a small flower stand

32:24.480 --> 32:26.079
or a small shop.

32:26.920 --> 32:28.279
Your business will continue to grow.

32:28.880 --> 32:30.640
If you attend to everything,

32:30.640 --> 32:31.720
then when will the people below you

32:31.720 --> 32:33.160
stand on their own?

32:33.160 --> 32:34.720
Yes, yes.

32:34.720 --> 32:36.599
You're right.

32:36.599 --> 32:37.880
But I have to overcome

32:37.880 --> 32:39.480
the current hurdle, right?

32:39.480 --> 32:40.759
What to do with this flower cultivating soil?

32:41.319 --> 32:43.000
Are we just going to leave it like this?

32:44.720 --> 32:46.000
I will help you get through this.

32:47.200 --> 32:48.559
I will apply fertilizer
to the flower cultivating soil.

32:48.559 --> 32:49.640
You take a rest.

32:49.640 --> 32:51.160
Forget it.

32:51.160 --> 32:52.680
Do you even know how to apply fertilizer?

32:53.400 --> 32:56.039
Besides, I can't afford to hire you.

32:56.039 --> 32:57.480
- No, no.
- Give it to me.

32:57.480 --> 32:59.119
- Give it to me.
- No, no.

33:01.160 --> 33:02.408
Come on.

33:02.408 --> 33:03.799
Come over here.

33:03.799 --> 33:06.079
Why sneak around in your own garden?

33:06.079 --> 33:07.119
I'm being sick.

33:07.119 --> 33:08.640
I don't want them to see me working.

33:08.640 --> 33:09.920
Otherwise, they will blame me

33:09.920 --> 33:11.680
for making them worry.

33:11.680 --> 33:13.440
Aren't you afraid of me worrying?

33:13.440 --> 33:14.440
Cut the crap and come here.

33:24.799 --> 33:26.640
If they really start fighting,

33:27.279 --> 33:29.240
should I go out or not?

33:35.079 --> 33:36.328
What?

33:37.720 --> 33:39.759
Just now, a little bug landed here.

33:41.799 --> 33:42.920
I didn't feel it.

33:44.160 --> 33:45.240
Today I was being hasty.

33:45.799 --> 33:47.039
Mr. Hu, don't take it to heart.

33:48.680 --> 33:49.920
It's all my fault for acting out

33:49.920 --> 33:50.960
and upsetting the shopkeeper.

33:51.480 --> 33:52.680
When digging channels for irrigation,

33:52.680 --> 33:53.880
I will be extremely careful

33:53.880 --> 33:55.240
and will not harm
the shopkeeper's flowers again.

33:57.759 --> 33:58.839
It's also my fault

33:58.839 --> 34:00.488
for speaking mean.

34:01.079 --> 34:02.319
From now on,

34:02.319 --> 34:03.759
let's work together

34:03.759 --> 34:05.279
and build the garden well.

34:05.279 --> 34:06.279
We must never

34:06.279 --> 34:07.480
let Lady He worry again.

34:08.559 --> 34:09.199
- Yes.
- Yes.

34:09.199 --> 34:10.559
Guys, come on, let's get to work.

34:10.559 --> 34:11.920
- Get to work.
- Let's work.

34:11.920 --> 34:13.360
Bring that over here.

34:14.000 --> 34:15.119
Come on, let's go down.

34:17.960 --> 34:19.719
They made peace

34:19.719 --> 34:20.920
because of you.

34:22.559 --> 34:24.159
It seems you

34:24.159 --> 34:25.400
are indeed a good shopkeeper.

34:27.079 --> 34:28.320
It's me

34:28.320 --> 34:29.760
who found a group of nice partners.

34:33.920 --> 34:34.920
This last batch of flowers

34:34.920 --> 34:35.960
is about to be planted well.

34:36.719 --> 34:38.039
When

34:38.039 --> 34:39.239
the canal is filled with water,

34:40.039 --> 34:41.199
the weather warms and the snow melts,

34:41.960 --> 34:43.400
a thousand branches will sprout

34:44.119 --> 34:45.159
and ten thousand flowers will bloom brightly.

34:46.400 --> 34:47.480
Then this garden

34:49.480 --> 34:50.880
will truly become a fragrant garden.

34:52.200 --> 35:00.552
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

35:00.552 --> 35:01.736
[Cold Dew]

35:01.736 --> 35:08.095
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

35:08.599 --> 35:09.896
Pretty good.

35:11.239 --> 35:12.559
To the pistil part,

35:12.559 --> 35:14.119
can you also blend colors with silk threads?

35:14.119 --> 35:15.639
Okay, I'll give it a try.

35:15.639 --> 35:17.679
Make the inside of this petal
a bit more natural.

35:19.960 --> 35:22.800
This dish is made by steaming preserved eggs.

35:22.800 --> 35:23.960
Does it taste good?

35:23.960 --> 35:25.480
It's very fresh and sweet.

35:25.480 --> 35:27.320
- Make it look more exquisite.
- Okay.

35:27.320 --> 35:28.800
- Make it into the shape of a petal.
- Sure.

35:31.360 --> 35:32.680
And this one.

35:40.599 --> 35:41.639
Seventy thousand strings.

35:41.639 --> 35:43.840
[Start of Winter]

35:43.840 --> 35:45.280
Ninety thousand strings.

35:45.280 --> 35:46.920
- One hundred thousand strings.
- Mr. Jiang.

35:46.920 --> 35:48.039
- No way.
- No way.

35:48.039 --> 35:49.840
- Mine.
- I won again.

35:49.840 --> 35:51.559
- It's Mr. Jiang who has won again.
- Good.

35:53.440 --> 35:54.760
Bring it over here.

35:55.760 --> 35:57.280
You came first.

35:57.280 --> 35:59.519
My lord, the mutton soup has arrived.

35:59.519 --> 36:01.039
Mr. Tang, Mr. Qi. Come have soup.

36:01.599 --> 36:03.559
Come and taste Huanyun Tower's mutton soup.

36:03.559 --> 36:05.079
Lady Li, have a taste.

36:09.736 --> 36:12.519
[Chinese New Year's Eve]

36:12.519 --> 36:15.400
- Both of you, drink up!
- Drink up!

36:15.400 --> 36:16.559
We toast to you.

36:16.559 --> 36:17.480
- Good
- Good.

36:17.480 --> 36:19.119
Mudan, have a bowl of meatball soup!

36:19.119 --> 36:20.520
Thank you, Liulang.

36:22.039 --> 36:23.240
You can't hit me.

36:25.199 --> 36:26.559
Chuanyu, where are you?

36:33.397 --> 36:41.653
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

36:41.653 --> 36:49.077
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

36:50.081 --> 36:57.531
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

37:05.018 --> 37:06.920
[Fragrance Garden]

37:06.920 --> 37:08.960
Seasonal leisurely fragrance.

37:08.960 --> 37:10.960
Garden witnesses the new year.

37:11.639 --> 37:13.199
- Fragrance Garden…
- Fragrance Garden.

37:13.199 --> 37:14.960
opens today.

37:25.599 --> 37:26.559
- Prizes over here!
- Prizes over here!

37:26.559 --> 37:27.848
Prizes over here!

37:29.107 --> 37:30.512
[Fragrance Garden]

37:32.158 --> 37:33.971
[Observation]

37:38.480 --> 37:39.559
Choose a fan.

37:41.840 --> 37:43.240
Beautiful.

37:46.507 --> 37:53.620
♫ Youth sets its own wandering path ♫

37:55.669 --> 37:58.795
♫ Let not the secular world constrain ♫

37:58.795 --> 38:01.963
♫ How can they guess with mundane eyes ♫

38:03.304 --> 38:05.416
[Flowers Wine]

38:08.459 --> 38:12.410
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

38:12.410 --> 38:14.123
♫ Reflecting the color of the sky ♫

38:15.960 --> 38:17.719
This flower smells so good.

38:17.719 --> 38:20.239
It's a pity it can't be taken away.

38:20.239 --> 38:22.079
If you wish to,

38:22.079 --> 38:24.679
any smell from this garden can be taken away.

38:25.199 --> 38:26.599
And you can also

38:26.599 --> 38:28.280
enjoy the peonies in the garden

38:28.280 --> 38:29.920
and make the order.

38:29.920 --> 38:31.432
This way, please.

38:34.639 --> 38:35.800
Besides Rosy Rouge,

38:35.800 --> 38:37.119
any other rouge?

38:37.840 --> 38:40.159
The garden scene delights the heart,
the fragrance lingers forever.

38:40.159 --> 38:41.679
This is the Fragrance Garden's way
of receiving guests.

38:41.679 --> 38:42.920
- This way.
- Thank you.

38:44.960 --> 38:46.480
You can take

38:46.480 --> 38:48.559
your favorite fragrance home

38:48.559 --> 38:50.400
and share it with your beloved ones.

38:50.400 --> 38:51.599
- Okay.
- Okay.

38:51.599 --> 38:52.960
Take your time.

38:52.960 --> 38:54.344
Okay.

38:55.560 --> 39:00.771
♫ Indulging and sinking ♫

39:00.771 --> 39:07.816
♫ Breaking free after twists and turns ♫

39:09.960 --> 39:11.239
Time flows like water,

39:12.000 --> 39:13.480
another spring day arrives.

39:14.599 --> 39:15.840
The current Fragrance Garden

39:16.440 --> 39:18.079
has flowers blooming all seasons,

39:18.800 --> 39:20.440
with customers from all around the world.

39:22.728 --> 39:25.360
♫ Flowers should bloom proudly ♫

39:25.360 --> 39:26.664
Mother,

39:27.559 --> 39:28.904
Yulu,

39:29.599 --> 39:30.984
Shengyi.

39:32.079 --> 39:33.440
Have you all seen this?

39:41.288 --> 39:46.278
[Garden full of spring's colors,
bidding farewell for now as spring arrives.]

39:46.278 --> 39:51.267
[Serve the country with splendid plans,
and continue a new chapter later.]

39:58.295 --> 40:04.569
♫ In endless Chang'an,
the zither's melody distant ♫

40:06.423 --> 40:13.107
♫ Plum and willow trees bask in the sunshine,
as splendor returns with the year ♫

40:13.783 --> 40:20.981
♫ Copper palace battlements,
songs and dances, glass goblets ♫

40:21.975 --> 40:30.327
♫ Idle clouds and duckweed,
a thousand flowers burst forth ♫

40:30.327 --> 40:37.870
♫ Time passes gracefully,
affairs settle like fading smoke ♫

40:38.524 --> 40:46.711
♫ Let the years go by,
carried by the wind to early desires ♫

40:46.711 --> 40:54.522
♫ If the heart is like water,
the bloom is ever-present ♫

40:55.127 --> 41:02.419
♫ Still cherish the moon of my hometown,
to meet for long ♫

41:23.095 --> 41:29.978
♫ The distant night sky strewn with stars,
reflecting the lovely moon ♫

41:31.279 --> 41:37.973
♫ The peony's magnificent beauty
fills the Fragrance Garden ♫

41:38.730 --> 41:46.032
♫ With a heart as my lantern,
I don't mind the distant mountain paths ♫

41:46.716 --> 41:55.025
♫ The flute's sound,
a fleeting life's wishes fulfilled ♫

